  "description": "Render a Rask component to HTML in a unit test, invoke its event handlers (clicks, input, submit), and assert on the re-rendered markup — no browser, no server, no WebSocket. RaskTest.Render(component) returns a RenderedComponent whose Html reflects the current state; InvokeAsync/ClickAsync dispatch a handler by its data-rask-on-* id and return the re-rendered HTML. Wraps Rask.Core's live-render + handler-dispatch seam. Reference from your test project; Rask.Core comes transitively from your app's Rask.Server / Rask.Wasm.",
